UPDATE companies SET description='Undaunted Apparel operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, and has been active since 2012. The company began as a private brand rooted in themes of freedom and veteran support, founded by a group of individuals who wanted to honor military service and conservation causes.

The business evolved from selling its own labeled hoodies, tees, and headwear into a contract decoration service for other companies and organizations. It runs a web-based design portal that lets customers upload artwork, choose from a library of graphics, and order custom-printed garments on demand. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

Clients range from corporate buyers ordering bulk logo wear — such as a Las Vegas company that placed a large T-shirt order — to nonprofit groups like Pedaling Against Poaching, veteran organizations, and motorsports teams including GRR and Reif Racing. The company also outfits individual athletes and outdoor enthusiasts through its "Teams" program, which spans animal-rights advocates, rescue squads, and competitive riders.

The founders state that the venture expanded into contract work after repeated requests from other brands asking how and where they produced their own merchandise. That demand led to a service model focused on helping partners bring products to market, while the original mission — supporting veterans, fighting poaching, and promoting a "Wear What Matters" ethos — remains central to the brand identity.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom screen printing", "Direct-to-garment printing", "Embroidery", "Online design tool with art library", "Contract decoration for brands", "Wholesale blank apparel supply", "Bulk order fulfillment", "Rewards program administration", "Affiliate program management"], "industries": ["Corporate branded merchandise", "Veteran and military organizations", "Wildlife conservation nonprofits", "Athletics and team sports", "Motorsports and automotive enthusiasts", "Outdoor recreation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Web-based design portal for upload-and-order custom apparel", "Contract decoration and fulfillment services for third-party brands", "Rewards and affiliate programs that pay customers for referrals", "Partnerships with veteran groups, conservation nonprofits, and athletes", "Fast turnaround on bulk T-shirt orders noted by corporate buyers"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Las Vegas, Nevada -> db", "Operating since 2012 -> /about-us", "Started as brand, expanded to contract sales for other companies -> /about-us", "Custom online design portal for upload-and-order -> /about-us", "Products: hoodies, tees, hats, challenge coins -> /", "Corporate bulk order testimonial (Teresa M., Las Vegas) -> /about-us", "Partnerships: Pedaling Against Poaching, veteran orgs, athletes, GRR/Reif Racing -> /about-us, /", "Rewards and affiliate programs -> /about-us", "Phone and hours -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_pr