UPDATE companies SET description='Universal Pure operates its Meriden, Connecticut headquarters alongside a major processing facility in Lincoln, Nebraska. The company provides high pressure processing (HPP) and cold‑chain services to food and beverage brands across North America. A founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

